      "originalText": "Before feeding a link back to the frontier, check:\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"nofollow\"> — don't follow any links on this page\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"...\"> — don't follow this specific link\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\"> — don't store this page's content\nLink points to excluded file type — skip .pdf, .zip, .exe etc. unless specifically crawling those",
